{"id":"wb-5-430","name":"伏羲庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"伏羲庙 (天水)","text":"伏羲庙位于中国甘肃省天水市秦州区伏羲路，1963年被列为甘肃省文物保护单位，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n伏羲庙始建于元至正七年（1347年），经明弘治、嘉靖年间大规模扩建形成现有格局，清嘉庆、光绪年间曾大修。伏羲庙坐北朝南，总占地13000平方米。在中轴线上由南至北有戏楼（隔伏羲路）、牌楼、大门、仪门、先天殿、太极殿、后花园等建筑，其中先天殿和太极殿为主体建筑。先天殿面阔七间，进深五间，重檐歇山顶，殿内有伏羲彩塑。太极殿为伏羲寝宫，单檐歇山顶。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8F%E7%BE%B2%E5%BA%99_(%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%B4)","revisionId":92633947,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92633947","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5e6da26586353f0b889336e2.jpg","title":"甘肃天水伏羲庙2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%94%98%E8%82%83%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%B4%E4%BC%8F%E7%BE%B2%E5%BA%992.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/%E7%94%98%E8%82%83%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%B4%E4%BC%8F%E7%BE%B2%E5%BA%992.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Smwy09","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​甘肃天水伏羲庙2","width":320,"height":239}}